OL,3,AUS tech stocks see sharp falls as AI
OL,4,Aspending nears $1tn
OL,5,
OL,6,FTech stocks tumbled for the second day
OL,7,Fin a row as concerns rise over the
OL,8,Fhundreds of billions of dollars firms
OL,9,Fare investing in artificial
OL,10,Fintelligence (AI).
OL,12,FShares in Intel plummeted by 28% on
OL,13,FFriday, while Google owner Alphabet saw
OL,14,Fits stock price continue to fall
OL,15,Fanother 1.4% after a 12% plunge on
OL,16,FThursday.
OL,18,FOther tech stocks, including Reddit and
OL,19,FAmazon also fell, while the Nasdaq
OL,20,Findex of the largest tech firms listed
OL,21,Fin the US, ended October with its worst
OL,22,Fmonthly slide since March 2025.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
