OL,5,G2130 From Our Own Correspondent
OL,6,     FThe cost of living is a crunch
OL,7,     Fissue for many voters, but will
OL,8,     Fthat favour Democrats at the
OL,9,     Fballot box or will Donald Trump's
OL,10,     Floyalists help keep congress under
OL,11,     FRepublican control?
